@userId = {{$uuid}}

### サインアップ
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/signup
Content-Type:  application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### ログイン
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type:  application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
  client.global.set("playerId", response.body.playerId);
%}

### プレイヤー追加
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type:  application/json

{
  "name": "テストプレイヤー"
}

### プレイヤー取得
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
